).", "benefitsText": "60% guarantee coverage by NCGTC on the loan. Loan amount guaranteed up to ₹100 crore (project can be larger). Repayment up to 8 years with up to 2 years moratorium for loans up to ₹50 crore; flexible schedule for larger loans. Upfront contribution of 5% of loan amount at application (refundable 1% each year from 4th year). Annual guarantee fee: nil in year of sanction; 1.5% p.a. for next 3 years; 1% p.a. thereafter. Exporter MSMEs: 75% guarantee cover for loans up to ₹20 crore; upfront contribution 2% (max ₹40 lakh); fee nil in first year and 0.50% p.a. thereafter.", "eligibilityText": "MSME with valid Udyam Registration Number. Service-sector MSMEs are also included (March 2026 modification). Cost of equipment/machinery must be at least 60% of project cost (reduced from 75%). Exporter window: profitable units exporting at least 25% of sales in the previous 3 financial years.", "applicationText": "Application via offline channel"}, "hi": {"name": "एमएसएमई के लिए पारस्परिक ऋण गारंटी योजना (MCGS-MSME)", "shortName": null, "summary": null, "description": null, "objective": null, "benefitsText": null, "eligibilityText": null, "applicationText": null}, "ta": {"name": null, "shortName": null, "summary": null, "description": null, "objective": null, "benefitsText": null, "eligibilityText": null, "applicationText": null}}, "metadata": {"catalogVersion": "1.35.1-alpha", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z", "recordStatus": "published", "revision": 1, "schemaVersion": "1.0.0", "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T19:30:32Z"}, "provenance": {"primarySourceId": "SCH000255-SRC001", "contributingSourceIds": ["SCH000255-SRC001"], "defaultSourceTier": 2, "extractedAt": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z", "extractionMethod": "automated", "fieldSources": [], "pipelineVersion": "catalog-v3.1-migration-1.35.1", "transformationNotes": ["Rebuilt to reference catalog shape in v3.1 migration"], "translations": {"hi": {"source": "booklet_2025_26_machine_hi", "status": "machine", "reviewRequire